{"step_index":47,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:12:52Z","content":"The **Jharkhand Tourism** website has been redesigned into an editorial-grade travel discovery platform.\n\nDetailed documentation and screenshots are available in the [Walkthrough Document](file:///C:/Users/Bhavish%20Sawant/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22b254db-894b-457d-9362-6954f3cf5219/walkthrough.md).\n\n---\n\n### 📂 Created Files & Project Structure\n\nThe project has been created inside:\n`C:\\Users\\Bhavish Sawant\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\jharkhand-tourism\\`\n\n- [**`index.html`**](file:///C:/Users/Bhavish%20Sawant/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/jharkhand-tourism/index.html): Semantic HTML5 structure with accessible landmarks, preloader, cinematic hero, interactive sections, modal container, and luxury footer.\n- [**`css/main.css`**](file:///C:/Users/Bhavish%20Sawant/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/jharkhand-tourism/css/main.css): Custom properties design system (deep forest greens, warm sand, champagne gold), card hover physics (`scale(1.08)` over `0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)`), custom desktop cursor, glassmorphic navbar, and responsive layouts.\n- [**`css/map.css`**](file:///C:/Users/Bhavish%20Sawant/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/jharkhand-tourism/css/map.css): Leaflet map dark styling, custom SVG markers for Famous (Gold) vs. Underrated (Emerald) destinations, pulsing rings, and custom popups.\n- [**`js/data.js`**](file:///C:/Users/Bhavish%20Sawant/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/jharkhand-tourism/js/data.js): Complete destination dataset preserving `type: \"famous\" | \"underrated\"`, fixed GPS coordinates, safety precautions, major safety warnings, elevation, timings, and cultural facts.\n- [**`js/map.js`**](file:///C:/Users/Bhavish%20Sawant/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/jharkhand-tourism/js/map.js): Leaflet interactive map setup, marker rendering, filter triggers, and smooth `flyTo` camera animation.\n- [**`js/app.js`**](file:///C:/Users/Bhavish%20Sawant/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/jharkhand-tourism/js/app.js): Preloader, sticky navigation, card rendering, desktop follower cursor (`VIEW` / `EXPLORE`), full-screen immersive modal with safety advisory cards, and ambient nature sound synthesizer.\n\n---\n\n### ✨ Key Features Implemented\n\n1. **Cinematic Hero**: Slow Ken Burns background motion, dark gradient vignette, bold editorial typography (`DISCOVER JHARKHAND` / *Where Nature Tells A Story*), CTA button with arrow hover glide, and animated scroll indicator.\n2. **Sticky Glass Navbar**: Transparent over the hero, transitioning into a blurred frosted glass bar upon scrolling. Includes an ambient nature audio synthesizer button (Web Audio API) and mobile drawer.\n3. **Card Hover & Desktop Cursor**:\n   - Image scales from `scale(1)` to `scale(1.08)` over `0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)`.\n   - Title glides upward by `6px`, category badge fades in, and \"Explore Destination →\" slides in with arrow motion.\n   - Smooth circular cursor follower (`VIEW` / `EXPLORE`) active strictly within cards on desktop.\n4. **Full-Screen Immersive Modal**:\n   - Large hero image with entrance reveal animation.\n   - Comprehensive narrative, highlights, best season, transit guide, and GPS coordinates.\n   - **PRECAUTION** card (soft emerald shield icon) & **MAJOR SAFETY WARNING** card (amber/crimson alert icon).\n   - \"View on Interactive Map\" action button that pans directly to the place on the map.\n5. **Interactive Map**: Custom dark tiles, distinct gold & emerald marker pins with pulsing beacons, custom preview popups, and instant camera fly-to on card click.\n6. **\"Did You Know?\" Micro-Interactions**: Curated cultural and geological storytelling moments placed between major sections.\n7. **Mobile UX & Accessibility**: Single-column responsive cards, touch-friendly buttons ($\\ge 44\\text{px}$), ARIA attributes, keyboard escape handling, and full `@media (prefers-reduced-motion)` support.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 How to Run the Website\n\nRun a local server with PowerShell or double-click `index.html`:\n\n```powershell\ncd \"C:\\Users\\Bhavish Sawant\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\jharkhand-tourism\"\npython -m http.server 3000\n```\nOpen **`http://localhost:3000`** in your browser."}
