{"step_index":57,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:31:21Z","thinking":"**Adding CSS Animations**\n\nI'm currently focused on enhancing `css/main.css`. I'm integrating interactive 3D perspective tilt on hover effects. I've defined `transform-style: preserve-3d;` and a transition using `cubic-bezier` for smoother mouse-tracking animations. The goal is to add dynamic visual appeal.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   JHARKHAND TOURISM - PREMIUM EDITORIAL DESIGN SYSTEM\n   Visual Identity: Deep Forest Green, Warm Sand, Muted Gold, Charcoal\n   Focus: FAMOUS DESTINATIONS with elevated, award-winning animations\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   CSS VARIABLES & DESIGN TOKENS\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n:root {\n  /* Color Palette - Refined Natural & Luxury */\n  --bg-prime: #061A13;            /* Deep Forest Night */\n  --bg-surface: #0B241B;          /* Deep Emerald Surface */\n  --bg-card: #0E2C22;             /* Forest Slate */\n  --bg-card-hover: #12372A;       /* Elevated Forest Surface */\n  --bg-light: #FBF9F5;            /* Editorial Warm Off-White */\n  --bg-light-surface: #F3EFEA;    /* Sand Off-White */\n  --bg-light-card: #FFFFFF;\n  \n  /* Text Colors */\n  --text-pure: #FFFFFF;\n  --text-main: #EDE8DE;           /* Soft Ivory */\n  --text-muted: #A3B8B0;          /* Muted Sage */\n  --text-dark: #141A17;           /* Charcoal Dark */\n  --text-dark-muted: #5E6964;     /* Medium Dark Slate */\n  \n  /* Luxury Accents */\n  --gold-prime: #C5A059;          /* Muted Champagne Gold */\n  --gold-light: #DFC27D;          /* Soft Radiant Gold */\n  --gold-dim: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15);\n  --gold-glow: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.35);\n  --emerald-accent: #10B981;\n  --emerald-glow: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);\n  --terracotta: #8D5B4C;\n  --warning-amber: #F59E0B;\n  --warning-bg: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);\n  --warning-border: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);\n  --precaution-green: #2DD4BF;\n  --precaution-bg: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.08);\n  --precaution-border: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.35);\n\n  /* Glassmorphism & Borders */\n  --glass-bg: rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.75);\n  --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  --glass-border-gold: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);\n  --glass-shadow: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n\n  /* Typography */\n  --font-serif: 'Playfair Display', 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;\n  --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n\n  /* Transitions & Easings */\n  --ease-luxury: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n  --ease-spring: cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n  --ease-smooth: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n  --transition-fast: 0.25s var(--ease-luxury);\n  --transition-normal: 0.5s var(--ease-luxury);\n  --transition-slow: 0.8s var(--ease-luxury);\n  --transition-kenburns: 26s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n\n  /* Layout */\n  --container-max: 1340px;\n  --nav-height: 86px;\n  --radius-sm: 6px;\n  --radius-md: 14px;\n  --radius-lg: 20px;\n  --radius-full: 9999px;\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   GLOBAL RESET & BASE STYLES\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n*, *::before, *::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nhtml {\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  background-color: var(--bg-prime);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\nbody {\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  background-color: var(--bg-prime);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\n/* Selection */\n::selection {\n  background-color: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: var(--bg-prime);\n}\n\n/* Custom Scrollbar */\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 8px;\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: var(--bg-prime);\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: #1A3D30;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n/* Scroll Progress Bar at the top of viewport */\n.scroll-progress-indicator {\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  width: 0%;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #C5A059, #DFC27D, #10B981);\n  z-index: 10000;\n  transition: width 0.1s ease-out;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.8);\n}\n\n/* Focus Outlines */\n:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--gold-prime);\n  outline-offset: 4px;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  display: block;\n}\n\na {\n  color: inherit;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: none;\n  background: none;\n  color: inherit;\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   TYPOGRAPHY\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\nh1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6,\n.font-serif {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  letter-spacing: -0.015em;\n  line-height: 1.15;\n}\n\n.eyebrow {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.6rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.22em;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.eyebrow::before {\n  content: '';\n  display: inline-block;\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n.section-heading {\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.section-subheading {\n  font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.15rem);\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-weight: 400;\n  max-width: 600px;\n}\n\n/* Atmospheric Background Typography Watermark */\n.watermark-bg {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 50%;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: clamp(5rem, 15vw, 14rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  user-select: none;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   LAYOUT UTILITIES\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.container {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: var(--container-max);\n  margin-left: auto;\n  margin-right: auto;\n  padding-left: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);\n  padding-right: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.section-padding {\n  padding-top: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8rem);\n  padding-bottom: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8rem);\n}\n\n.section-header {\n  margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);\n}\n\n.section-header.text-center {\n  text-align: center;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.section-header.text-center .eyebrow::after {\n  content: '';\n  display: inline-block;\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n.flex-between {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   PRELOADER / BRAND LOADING SCREEN (ELEVATED ANIMATION)\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.preloader {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 99999;\n  background: #040F0B;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  transition: opacity 0.8s var(--ease-luxury), visibility 0.8s, transform 0.8s var(--ease-luxury);\n}\n\n.preloader.hidden {\n  opacity: 0;\n  visibility: hidden;\n  transform: scale(1.04);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.preloader-content {\n  text-align: center;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n.preloader-symbol {\n  width: 52px;\n  height: 52px;\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--gold-prime);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  animation: preloader-spin 6s linear infinite;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);\n}\n\n@keyframes preloader-spin {\n  0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n  100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n}\n\n.preloader-logo {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.preloader-tagline {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.3em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  opacity: 0.9;\n}\n\n.preloader-bar {\n  width: 200px;\n  height: 2px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  margin-top: 1.5rem;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border-radius: 1px;\n}\n\n.preloader-progress {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  height: 100%;\n  width: 0%;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold-prime), var(--gold-light));\n  animation: preloader-load 1.2s var(--ease-luxury) forwards;\n}\n\n@keyframes preloader-load {\n  0% { width: 0%; }\n  100% { width: 100%; }\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   STICKY NAVIGATION BAR\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.navbar {\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  z-index: 1000;\n  padding: 1.5rem 0;\n  transition: padding var(--transition-normal), background var(--transition-normal), border var(--transition-normal), box-shadow var(--transition-normal);\n}\n\n.navbar.scrolled {\n  padding: 0.9rem 0;\n  background: rgba(6, 26, 19, 0.88);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\n.nav-container {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.brand-logo {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: transform var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.brand-logo:hover {\n  transform: scale(1.03);\n}\n\n.brand-symbol {\n  width: 34px;\n  height: 34px;\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--gold-prime);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25);\n}\n\n.brand-text {\n  font-family: var(--font-serif);\n  font-size: 1.35rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.brand-text span {\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n}\n\n.nav-links {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 2.25rem;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.nav-link {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  position: relative;\n  padding: 0.4rem 0;\n  transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.nav-link::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 0;\n  height: 1.5px;\n  background: var(--gold-prime);\n  transition: width var(--transition-normal);\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover,\n.nav-link.active {\n  color: var(--text-pure);\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover::after,\n.nav-link.active::after {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.nav-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n/* Audio Ambience Button */\n.audio-toggle-btn {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.audio-toggle-btn:hover {\n  border-color: var(--gold-prime);\n  color: var(--gold-prime);\n  background: var(--